<script setup>
import {useRoom} from '../stores/room'
const room=useRoom()
</script>
<template><section class="room-controls" aria-label="방 배치 편집"><div class="toolbar"><button class="light" :disabled="!room.loaded||room.busy" @click="room.editing=true">🏡 방 편집</button><template v-if="room.editing"><button :disabled="room.busy" @click="room.save">{{room.busy?'저장 중…':'방 저장'}}</button><button class="light" :disabled="room.busy" @click="room.cancel">편집 취소</button></template><span v-if="room.dirty">저장하지 않은 변경 있음</span></div><template v-if="room.editing"><div class="room-colors"><label>벽 색상<input v-model="room.design.wall" type="color" :disabled="room.busy"/></label><label>바닥 색상<input v-model="room.design.floor" type="color" :disabled="room.busy"/></label><label><input v-model="room.design.grid" type="checkbox" :disabled="room.busy"/> 격자 표시</label></div><div class="room-presets"><button v-for="preset in [{name:'하늘',wall:'#e8f7ff',floor:'#c5e7fa'},{name:'핑크',wall:'#ffedf8',floor:'#f5cfe5'},{name:'라벤더',wall:'#f2eaff',floor:'#ddd0f3'},{name:'민트',wall:'#e8fff3',floor:'#c4e9d7'},{name:'크림',wall:'#fff8e8',floor:'#ecdec2'},{name:'기본',wall:'#ffffff',floor:'#ffffff'}]" :key="preset.name" class="light" :disabled="room.busy" @click="room.design.wall=preset.wall;room.design.floor=preset.floor">{{preset.name}} 방</button></div><div v-if="room.selectedPlacement" class="room-placement-controls"><b>{{room.selectedItem?.name}}</b><label>크기 {{Math.round(room.selectedPlacement.size)}}%<input v-model.number="room.selectedPlacement.size" type="range" min="4" max="60" :disabled="room.busy"/></label><label>좌우 위치<input v-model.number="room.selectedPlacement.x" type="range" min="0" max="100" :disabled="room.busy"/></label><label>위아래 위치<input v-model.number="room.selectedPlacement.y" type="range" min="0" max="100" :disabled="room.busy"/></label><label>회전<input v-model.number="room.selectedPlacement.rotation" type="range" min="-180" max="180" :disabled="room.busy"/></label><label><input v-model="room.selectedPlacement.front" type="checkbox" :disabled="room.busy"/> 포켓몬 앞에 놓기</label><button class="light" :disabled="room.busy" @click="room.remove">배치 해제 · 내 아이템으로</button></div><p v-else>오른쪽 ‘방꾸미기 → 내 아이템’에서 장식을 선택하고 방을 클릭하세요. 이미 놓인 장식도 클릭하면 다시 옮길 수 있어요.</p></template><p v-if="room.notice" role="status">{{room.notice}}</p><p v-if="room.error" role="alert">{{room.error}} <button class="text-button" :disabled="room.busy" @click="room.load">서버 방 다시 불러오기</button></p></section></template>
<style scoped>
.room-controls{margin:18px 0;padding:12px;border:2px solid var(--rpg-mid);border-radius:8px;background:var(--rpg-soft)}.room-controls p,.room-controls span{font-size:11px;line-height:1.8}.room-presets{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:10px 0}.room-presets button{padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px}.room-colors{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin:12px 0}.room-colors label{font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.room-colors input[type=color]{width:48px;height:34px;padding:2px}.room-placement-controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.room-placement-controls label{font-size:12px}.room-placement-controls input[type=range]{width:100%;min-width:0}.room-placement-controls>b{grid-column:1/-1}.room-controls .toolbar{flex-wrap:wrap}@media(max-width:500px){.room-placement-controls{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
